config AIF_ET_ISA_MIGRATION
	bool "AIFoundry ET ISA migration custom instruction intrinsics"
	help
	  Enable include/zephyr/arch/riscv/aif/xaifet.h wrappers for the nine
	  approved custom-0/custom-1 migration targets in
	  harness/config/encoding_plan.yaml.  Emission uses raw .word when the
	  Zephyr SDK assembler does not yet provide the migrated mnemonics.
